  "comment": "Standard recheck cadences for common labs. Each rule has `aliases` (matched case-insensitively against the user's lab.name), `weeks` (default interval), and optional `triggered_by_stack` (if the user added one of these factors, use the shorter `weeks_after_stack_change` instead). The cadence engine fires a push when the user's most-recent lab exceeds the recheck window — extended if the lab was already in-range, urgent if out-of-range.",
